# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JEDDA Waitlist & Anti-Jastip — .gitignore
# See README.md → "Secrets & what must stay out of Git"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Local agent / tooling settings (may contain machine-specific allowlists)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/settings.local.json

# ⚠️ SECRETS — DO NOT COMMIT
# The raw WPCode snippet EXPORTS below embed the Supabase ANON key AND a
# SERVICE_ROLE key (full RLS bypass = read/write/delete the entire
# jedda-atelier database). Never commit the raw exports.
# Sanitized copies (keys replaced with placeholders) live in
# migration/sanitized/ and ARE tracked — see the negation below.
migration/*.json
migration/**/*.json
!migration/sanitized/
!migration/sanitized/**

# Generic secret files
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
service-role*.txt

# Node / build output (in case tooling is added later)
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.log
